{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16663","headline":"西亭暇日书怀十二韵献上相公 · 李夷简","name":"西亭暇日书怀十二韵献上相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜赏不在远，怃然念玄搜。\n兹亭有殊致，经始富人侯。\n澄澹分沼沚，萦回间林丘。\n荷香夺芳麝，石溜当鸣球。\n抚俗来康济，经邦去咨谋。\n宽明洽时论，惠爱闻甿讴。\n代斵岂容易，守成获优游。\n文翁旧学校，子产昔田畴。\n琬琰富佳什，池台想旧游。\n谁言矜改作，曾是日增修。\n宪省忝陪属，岷峨嗣徽猷。\n提携当有路，勿使滞刀州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李夷简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}